I cannot puzzle out the above paragraph.  No flame intended.

Look, no one is saying that *every* game of nethack should be the
same (how dull!) but rather that if a bunch of people want to 
compete to see who can get the best score *on a given dungeon*, it
should be possible.

Why should it be possible?  Because the role of luck in nethack can be 
absurdly large, especially in the first few levels -- too large to
make any comparisons meaningful.

